{"symbol":"ADESHWAR","yahoo":"ADESHWAR.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Adeshwar Meditex Limited","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","website":"https://adeshwarmeditex.com","about":"Adeshwar Meditex Limited manufactures, processes, exports, distributes, and supplies medical consumables and healthcare solutions in India and internationally. It offers sterile wound dressings under PETRONET, PARAHEAL, BACTIGAUZE PLUS, NITROHEAL, PIVIDINE POVITULLE, POVIZOLE, FRAMITULLE, FUSITULLE, CALGINATE-AG SILVINET, HYDRASOOTHE, POLYBANE, and POLYBANE-N brands; combine dressings, such as eye pads under the COMBIDRESS and COMBIPAD brands; and gauze dressing and cotton products, such as cotton stockinette, kneecaps, cast paddings under the ORTHOWRAP brand, rolled cotton bandages, absorbent cotton wool, abdominal pads, gauze swabs, and triangular bandages. It also provides plasters comprising elastic adhesive bandages under the A + M PLAST brand, cohesive bandages under the GLUBAN brand, adhesive tapes under the M Tape brand, microporous tapes under the AMPORE brand, synthetic casts, plaster of paris bandages under the A + MEDISET brand, capsicum belladonna perforated plasters, and cotton crepe bandages under the A + M CREPE brand; antiseptics/disinfectants under the BIODEX-C, BIO CLEAN, VILON-N, Pividine, Pividine-S, BENZ VETOL, Pividine-C, and BID QUAT brands; examination gloves and medical kits, surgical blades and blood lancets. In addition, it offers medical bandages, such as elastic, adhesive and non-adhesive tapes, such as medicated and non-medicated, military dressings, orthopedic bandages, soft products and equipment, sanitary napkins, infusion sets and allied products, antiseptic solutions, disinfectants, hand sanitizers, ointments, rectified spirit, extra neutral ethyl alcohol, and alcohol based products, sterile home based newborn and other kits, face masks, caps, gowns, face shield, PPE kits, HIV kits, hospital protective wears and disposables, laboratory reagents, and testing kits. It serves hospitals, medical centers, households, and schools; and the automobile and defense industries. The company was founded in 1951 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:06:01+00:00","quote":{"price":16.89,"prevClose":16.89,"marketCap":24.37,"high52":21.8,"low52":13.0,"pe":19.19,"bookValue":26.52,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":3.36,"shares":1.4431,"insiders":82.53,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-06-28","2021-06-29","2021-06-30","2021-07-01","2021-07-02","2021-07-05","2021-07-06","2021-07-07","2021-07-08","2021-07-09","2021-07-12","2021-07-13","2021-07-14","2021-07-15","2021-07-16","2021-07-19","2021-07-20","2021-07-22","2021-07-23","2021-07-26","2021-07-27","2021-07-28","2021-07-29","2021-07-30","2021-08-02","2021-08-03","2021-08-04","2021-08-05","2021-08-06","2021-08-09","2021-08-10","2021-08-11","2021-08-12","2021-08-13","2021-08-16","2021-08-17","2021-08-18","2021-08-20","2021-08-23","2021-08-24","2021-08-25","2021-08-26","2021-08-27","2021-08-30","2021-08-31","2021-09-01","2021-09-02","2021-09-03","2021-09-06","2021-09-07","2021-09-08","2021-09-09","2021-09-13","2021-09-14","2021-09-15","2021-09-16","2021-09-17","2021-09-20","2021-09-21","2021-09-22","2021-09-23","2021-09-24","2021-09-27","2021-09-28","2021-09-29","2021-09-30","2021-10-01","2021-10-04","2021-10-05","2021-10-06","2021-10-07","2021-10-08","2021-10-11","2021-10-12","2021-10-13","2021-10-14","2021-10-18","2021-10-19","2021-10-20","2021-10-21","2021-10-22","2021-10-25","2021-10-26","2021-10-27","2021-10-28","2021-10-29","2021-11-01","2021-11-02","2021-11-03","2021-11-04","2021-11-08","2021-11-09","2021-11-10","2021-11-11","2021-11-12","2021-11-15","2021-11-16","2021-11-17","2021-11-18","2021-11-22","2021-11-23","2021-11-24","2021-11-25","2021-11-26","2021-11-29","2021-11-30","2021-12-01","2021-12-02","2021-12-03","2021-12-06","2021-12-07","2021-12-08","2021-12-09","2021-12-10","2021-12-13","2021-12-14","2021-12-15","2021-12-